---
// Content migrated verbatim from the original monolithic index.html.
---
<section id="testimonials" class="testimonials-section">
    <!-- PREMIUM ENHANCEMENT: leaf watermark, right-alternating this time. -->
    <div class="leaf-watermark leaf-right" data-depth="0.5" style="top:2%; right:-11%;" aria-hidden="true">
        <picture><source srcset="/leaf.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/leaf.png" alt="" loading="lazy"></picture>
    </div>


    <div class="testi-header" data-reveal="soft-rise">
        <div class="testi-tag">
            <picture><source srcset="/IMG.2.webp" type="image/webp"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/IMG.2.PNG" alt="leaf"></picture> CLIENT LOVE
        </div>
        <h2 class="testi-headline">The Freshness We Have Served</h2>
        <div style="width:50px;height:2px;background:rgba(45,82,60,0.25);margin:16px auto 20px;border-radius:2px;"></div>
        <p class="testi-sub">Real stories from real clients who trusted us to grow their brand and saw real results.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="testi-carousel-wrap" data-reveal="paper-unfold">
        <div class="testi-track-outer">
            <div class="testi-track" id="testiTrack">

                <!-- Card 1 -->
                <div class="testi-card active">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">A</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                        <div class="testi-stars">
                            <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Mint Marketing transformed our social media presence completely. Their strategy, content, and consistent execution helped us increase engagement and double our leads in just 3 months!</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Ananya Sharma</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Founder, Glow Skincare</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2 -->
                <div class="testi-card">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">R</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                        <div class="testi-stars">
                            <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">The team is incredibly professional and very easy to work with. They built our social media strategy from scratch and made our brand stand out in a very competitive market.</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Rohit Mehta</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">CEO, FitFuel</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div class="testi-card">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">P</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                        <div class="testi-stars">
                            <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Creative, professional, and result-driven. Their campaigns delivered results far beyond our expectations. We saw a 60% jump in organic reach within the first month. Highly recommend!</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Priya Kapur</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Co-Founder, Maison De Decor</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4 -->
                <div class="testi-card">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">S</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                        <div class="testi-stars">
                            <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Working with Mint Marketing felt like having a full in-house team. They understood our brand voice instantly and every piece of content felt genuinely on-brand. Outstanding work.</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Sameer Arora</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Director, Sattva Wellness</div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 5 -->
                <div class="testi-card">
                    <div class="testi-card-top">
                        <div class="testi-avatar-wrap">
                            <div class="testi-avatar-placeholder">N</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="testi-quote-icon">"</div>
                        <div class="testi-stars">
                            <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testi-body">Mint hai to hit hai — and they truly live by it! Our restaurant's Instagram went from 800 to 12,000 followers in four months and our weekend bookings doubled. Pure magic.</p>
                    <div class="testi-divider"></div>
                    <div class="testi-name">Nadia Khan</div>
                    <div class="testi-role">Owner, The Green Table</div>
                </div>

            </div><!-- /testi-track -->
        </div><!-- /testi-track-outer -->

        <div class="testi-nav">
            <button class="testi-btn" id="testiBtnPrev" aria-label="Previous">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="testi-dots" id="testiDots"></div>
            <button class="testi-btn" id="testiBtnNext" aria-label="Next">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

